            "kind": "text",
            "id": "c019",
            "text": "Atlas is the design system used by Northstar's product team. Colors, spacing, radii, and type ramps are variables in four collections, and every component reads from them, so switching a whole screen to dark mode is one mode change. Includes buttons, inputs, tables, toasts, navigation, and data cards, each with a documentation page in the file."
